  "paragraph": 9,
  "text": "Hidden inside the host are lightweight connectors called MCP clients. Think of a client as a dedicated translator living inside your AI app. Each client maintains a clean one-to-one connection with a single MCP server—a small, focused program whose only job is to expose one specific workspace or capability, such as your local files, Slack, or Notion.",
